# Production build environment for the MegaBasket frontend (loaded by `vite build`).
# Local development (`vite dev`) does NOT load this file — it uses the Vite proxy
# to the local backend (http://localhost:5001) as configured in vite.config.js.
# No backend secrets belong here — this only tells the browser where the API lives.
VITE_API_URL=https://groceryweb-y7um.onrender.com
